 573:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c **** /** Handler to check the list of subscribed objects for any that have changed
 574:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *  and so need to have notifications sent.
 575:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * @ingroup DSCOV
 576:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * This handler will be invoked by the main program every second or so.
 577:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * This example only handles Binary Inputs, but can be easily extended to
 578:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * support other types.
 579:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * For each subscribed object,
 580:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *  - See if the subscription has timed out
 581:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *    - Remove it if it has timed out.
 582:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *  - See if the subscribed object instance has changed
 583:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *    (eg, check with Binary_Input_Change_Of_Value() )
 584:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *  - If changed,
 585:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *    - Clear the COV (eg, Binary_Input_Change_Of_Value_Clear() )
 586:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *    - Send the notice with cov_send_request()
 587:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *      - Will be confirmed or unconfirmed, as per the subscription.
 588:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *
 589:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * @note worst case tasking: MS/TP with the ability to send only
 590:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *        one notification per task cycle.
 591:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *
 592:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * @param elapsed_seconds [in] How many seconds have elapsed since last called.
 593:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  */
 594:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c **** void handler_cov_timer_seconds(
