 788:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c **** /** Handler for a COV Subscribe Service request.
 789:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * @ingroup DSCOV
 790:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * This handler will be invoked by apdu_handler() if it has been enabled
 791:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * by a call to apdu_set_confirmed_handler().
 792:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * This handler builds a response packet, which is
 793:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * - an Abort if
 794:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *   - the message is segmented
 795:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *   - if decoding fails
 796:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * - an ACK, if cov_subscribe() succeeds
 797:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * - an Error if cov_subscribe() fails
 798:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *
 799:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * @param service_request [in] The contents of the service request.
 800:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * @param service_len [in] The length of the service_request.
 801:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * @param src [in] BACNET_ADDRESS of the source of the message
 802:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  * @param service_data [in] The BACNET_CONFIRMED_SERVICE_DATA information
 803:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  *                          decoded from the APDU header of this message.
 804:../src/middleware/bacnet/demo/handler/h_cov.c ****  */
